#HELPS

0 CLASS CLASSES KITS CLASSKITS~
GENESIS: 2k26 | CLASS HELP

Genesis has 19 standalone parent classes, each with its own progression,
resources and powers. Use AUTOCLASS to see enrollment choices and
AUTOCLASS <class> [clan] to join when eligible.

Available classes - open the matching help page for kit details:

 - Angel         - HELP ANGEL
 - Cyborg        - HELP CYBORG
 - Deathknight   - HELP DEATHKNIGHT
 - Demon         - HELP DEMON
 - Dragon        - HELP DRAGON
 - Drow          - HELP DROW
 - Elemental     - HELP ELEMENTAL
 - Gargoyle      - HELP GARGOYLE
 - Highlander    - HELP HIGHLANDER
 - Kuei-jin      - HELP KUEIJIN
 - Mage          - HELP MAGE
 - Monk          - HELP MONK
 - Moogle        - HELP MOOGLE
 - Ninja         - HELP NINJA
 - Phoenix       - HELP PHOENIX
 - Sorcerer      - HELP SORCERER
 - Vampire       - HELP VAMPIRE
 - Werewolf      - HELP WEREWOLF
 - Wraith        - HELP WRAITH

Sorcerer is the book mage, including the Chaos Book Mage playstyle.
Mage is the separate sphere/Arete class. HELP CLASSBONUSES explains
progression benefits; HELP CLASSMENUS explains the live menu columns.
HELP KITSTATUS states verification limits. Hybrid conversion, ascension
and respec are not enabled.
~

